# Cargo timings
cargo-timing-*.html
cargo-timing.html

# vendor/ is pinned crate source; cargo's directory-source checksums verify every
# file at build time. The dev-tree rules above also match paths inside vendored
# crates -- `target` strips the cc crate's src/target/ module, `*.snap` strips
# insta snapshots -- stripping them on commit and breaking the offline build.
!vendor/**/target/
!vendor/**/*.snap
